UK, Brazil and South Africa is remains quite good.&nbsp;
So in total, is it logical to be pretty optimistic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:54.720
right now about the next four to six months?
I am both optimistic and worried. I'm&nbsp;&nbsp;

