early infections, and yet they're having&nbsp;
a lot of new infections with that variant.&nbsp;

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:19.760
Yes. And the other reason I'm worried is that&nbsp;
there is some inequity in the distribution of&nbsp;&nbsp;

